{"name": "Vampires: Bloodlord Rising", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are Dragos. A survivor of a vampire attack, turned into a creature of the night. Roam the <strong>open world</strong> of medieval Sangavia and forge a powerful <strong>Vampire Dominion</strong>. Build your <strong>castle</strong>, turn <strong>villagers into servants</strong> and explore a <strong>vast gothic-inspired open world</strong>. Whether you <strong>play solo or in co-op</strong>, your choices define your legacy. Will you reign from a palace of terror, or become the lord your people need?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"71\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/17f45c500be54d044dc66c437acf10d9.avif?t=1783590265\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORE A DARK, OPEN WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"230\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/a4baa692e6badc45c18fb21e546ea651.poster.avif?t=1783590265\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/a4baa692e6badc45c18fb21e546ea651.webm?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You awaken from slumber as a weakened vampire lord in the cursed land of Sangavia. <strong>Rebuild your fallen castle</strong>. Its heart, the <strong>Castle Core</strong>, is still pulsing with ancient hunger. <strong>Fuel the Core with blood</strong>\u00a0to <strong>unlock new regions</strong>, <strong>discover hidden areas</strong> shrouded in mist, and <strong>reclaim your power</strong> in a <strong>dark action-adventure</strong> with <strong>castle building</strong>, <strong>exploration</strong> and <strong>RPG elements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/7b64f43091e874bc0238bf35436de8ed.webp?t=1783590265\" width=\"50\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILD YOUR DREAM CASTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"230\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/8332b09779e29819980b209271412d74.poster.avif?t=1783590265\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/8332b09779e29819980b209271412d74.webm?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/8332b09779e29819980b209271412d74.mp4?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rebuild your fortress</strong> and shape it to your will - towering halls, secret chambers, and gothic spires rising from the night. Your castle is your refuge, your power, and the true symbol of your <strong>growing dominion</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/7b64f43091e874bc0238bf35436de8ed.webp?t=1783590265\" width=\"50\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GROW YOUR VAMPIRE FOLLOWING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"230\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/827d363fa7a9ac931ed5d28db32153b9.poster.avif?t=1783590265\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/827d363fa7a9ac931ed5d28db32153b9.webm?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world is filled with prey. <strong>Feed on humans and beasts</strong> that roam the night to <strong>regain your strength</strong> and fuel your <strong>dark rituals</strong>. Command loyal <strong>vampire thralls</strong> to serve your will - from <strong>crafting</strong>, <strong>hunting</strong>, and <strong>building</strong> to protecting your <strong>dark empire</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/7b64f43091e874bc0238bf35436de8ed.webp?t=1783590265\" width=\"50\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CO-OP MULTIPLAYER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"230\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/da2dffd4e1befe28ea0769eb8c28b009.poster.avif?t=1783590265\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/da2dffd4e1befe28ea0769eb8c28b009.webm?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/da2dffd4e1befe28ea0769eb8c28b009.mp4?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a Child of the Night, you don\u2019t have to be alone. <strong>Invite your friends to rule the land as equals</strong> and see where your individual decisions lead you. Unleash your creativity when you <strong>build your castle together</strong>. Explore the grim, sinister and bloody Sangavia as a team and face the dangers waiting in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/7b64f43091e874bc0238bf35436de8ed.webp?t=1783590265\" width=\"50\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SURVIVE AS A VAMPIRE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"230\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/d2cdad81fafb8a5dcc5b6d51ce33c739.poster.avif?t=1783590265\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/d2cdad81fafb8a5dcc5b6d51ce33c739.webm?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/d2cdad81fafb8a5dcc5b6d51ce33c739.mp4?t=1783590265\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To <strong>survive the night</strong>, you must evolve your <strong>vampiric abilities</strong> through an intricate <strong>skill tree</strong> and embrace the forms that shape your legacy. Shift between the <strong>Aristocrat</strong> and <strong>Hunter</strong> forms, or <strong>transform into a bat</strong> to roam the skies and uncover distant lands.\u00a0Power invites resistance, and the <strong>Inquisition</strong> will never stop hunting you. Crush their holy warriors in brutal, <strong>skill-based combat</strong> to defend your vampire reign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"71\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/17f45c500be54d044dc66c437acf10d9.avif?t=1783590265\" width=\"1500\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Feed the Castle Core, awaken forgotten power, and uncover the secrets of Sangavia. Rule the night alone, or rise alongside up to three allies in 4-player co-op.</strong></p> </div>", "short_desc": "In this dark, open-world adventure, you awaken as a Vampire Lord. Build and customize your castle. Hunt for blood, fight, craft, and gather. Command your loyal servants. Shapeshift into a bat to explore the night and survive the relentless Inquisition, solo or in 4-player co-op.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/header.jpg?t=1783590265", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Vampires", "Adventure", "Open World", "Base Building", "Survival"], "developers": "Mehuman Games", "publishers": "Mehuman Games", "release_date": "Jan 30, 2026", "price": "$19.99", "appid": "2191500", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "1 August 2025 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/5cx4_95GdVQ", "first_seen": 1754006400.0, "review_rank": 1538}